    {
      "actor": {
        "id": "codex-design-author",
        "role": "design"
      },
      "id": "new-operation-failure-dispatch",
      "rationale": "CLI-DEC-06 resolves the design-review-f2 implementation ambiguity: recognized review.set/verify.set select result schema 3 before store validation for every outcome. Existing operations remain schema 2 until validated v3 selection; unknown commands and early batch failures retain schema 2. Schema-2 vocabulary stays closed. Failure record_contract is omitted and unavailable revision/change identity is not fabricated. Ten complete failure examples cover both commands, unknown/mixed input and selector controls. This is an author correction proposal, not reviewer disposition or runtime adoption.",
