      "actor": {
        "id": "codex-design-author",
        "role": "design"
      },
      "id": "v3-finding-read-metadata",
      "rationale": "V3 Finding items now omit origin_available entirely; full fields match all eight stored members and summary omits exactly evidence/resolution. Review embedded findings use the same stored shape without item metadata. V2 findings and v2/v3 blockers retain origin metadata. Complete finding.show and context summary request/response examples establish the explicit contrast. This author correction addresses design-review-f3 without asserting reporter disposition or approval.",
